+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#42121"
+msgid "A few SDR videos (some Ultra HD Blu-rays and some streams) are made with the wider colours of BT.2020. Off (the default): they are converted to the ordinary colours of BT.709, as Kodi always does, and colours outside them are clipped. On: they go out as they are, with the menus and subtitles converted to match, on a display that says it takes BT.2020 (in its EDID); elsewhere they play as with this off. Other videos are not affected. kodi.log says how each such video goes out. Applies from the next video."
